sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant API as FastAPI Route
    participant TrackingService
    participant Scanner as MealScannerService
    participant LLM as LLM Gateway (Vision)
    participant PgVector as pgvector (CentralFood)

    User->>+API: POST /tracking/meals/scan<br/>(photo file)
    Note over API: JWT auth extracts user_id

    API->>+TrackingService: scan_meal(user_id, image)
    TrackingService->>+Scanner: scan_meal(image)

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over Scanner,LLM: Step 1: Image Analysis
        Scanner->>Scanner: Encode image to base64
        Scanner->>+LLM: Identify foods and estimate portions<br/>(Qwen2.5-VL vision model)
        LLM-->>-Scanner: Identified foods with portions
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Scanner,PgVector: Step 2: Match Foods
        loop For each identified food
            Scanner->>+PgVector: Vector similarity search<br/>on CentralFood table
            PgVector-->>-Scanner: Closest match with nutritional info
        end
    end

    Scanner-->>-TrackingService: Matched foods + nutritional breakdown
    TrackingService-->>-API: MealScanResponse
    API-->>-User: 200 OK<br/>{matched_foods[], nutritional_data}

    Note over User: User reviews matches,<br/>confirms via POST /tracking/logs
